      "instance_name": "harmful_trivialization",
      "label": "emotion of harmful trivialization",
      "description": "The image expresses a harmful and offensive emotion by trivializing the suffering of Jesus Christ and equating it with the atrocities of the Nazi regime, thereby minimizing the gravity of the Holocaust. This emotional expression is rooted in historical revisionism and anti-Semitic stereotypes, aiming to provoke shock or cynicism by forcing an inappropriate comparison.",
